{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309390","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130939001:1":{"text":"バードマウントに決まってるじゃない！この鳥は速くて賢いから、付近の集落ではみんな飼ってるのよ。","source_cn":"当然是靠陆行鸟了！它们跑得快，又聪明，附近的部落都养了一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27490C4B1ADBFE81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130939002:1":{"text":"そもそも、私とオキーラが鹹水町に助けを求めに行くことになったのも、バードマウントが、突然命令を無視して、暴れ出したからよ。","source_cn":"要不是之前它们莫名其妙攻击大家，不听命令，部落也不会派...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59F9A16DBE8EF946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130939003:1":{"text":"でも、もう大丈夫。従順な元のバードマウントに戻ったからね！","source_cn":"还好现在没事了，陆行鸟又变得听话了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E4D052C43F12DBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130939004:1":{"text":"こう考えると、私たちは本当にバードマウントなしでは生きていけないみたい。","source_cn":"这么一想，我们还真是离不开它呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B8F36541A7B288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血塔比提":{"text":"ババリアのダビーチェ","source":"蛮血塔比提","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}